Maintainer: WuzNab <87038818+WuzNab@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/WuzNab/DeskChalk
Description: Draw labeled boxes on your desktop wallpaper, behind your icons
 A tiny tray app for sorting desktop chaos. Draw boxes on the desktop, name
 them, and drag your icons into them. The boxes are painted into the
 wallpaper, so they sit behind the icons and never touch your files.
